WEBVTT

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:09.220
What'd you expect from the famous
Alice-san, the number one cosplayer?

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.740
I need her to look this way no matter what!

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:16.700
E-Excuse me!

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.580
Can... Can I have one photo?

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.780
Sure!

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.460
What pose would you like?

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:24.980
P-Pose?!

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:27.800
I'll let you decide.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.850
Well then, I'll do you-know-what.

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:32.320
Oh, okay!

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:35.090
Nightmare Impact!

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:40.100
Geez, what is it?

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:47.780
Only a dream?

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:52.280
<i>On the last day of my summer break,</i>

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:57.660
<i>I felt like I had encountered
something that would change me.</i>

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:35.380
August 20th, and it'll soon be ten past seven.

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.380
Are your morning preparations complete?

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:42.260
The new school term starts today,
but the next few days will still be hot.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.480
Best of luck, everyone!

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:44.880
Take care!

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:47.600
Bye!

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.540
You need to hurry up, Niiyan!

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.070
Good morning!

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:57.080
Good morning.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:59.320
Good morning, Maeda-kun.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.040
Hey, morning.

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:02.400
It's been a while.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:04.400
How was your summer?

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:07.330
I pretty much spent the break doing nothing.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.900
I see.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:11.900
I've been seeing Kano-chan every day at club practice,

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:14.640
but I didn't get to see you even once.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.000
Is that a camera?

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.280
What's going on?

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:20.720
Oh.

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:25.440
My dad bought himself a new camera, so he gave me this one.

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:28.220
Wow, amazing! Seriously!

00:03:28.550 --> 00:03:30.780
It's like one of those cameras that pros use!

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:34.020
Good morning!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.730
G-Good morning...

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:36.730
...morning...

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:40.320
Going to school together? How nice!

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.490
I always wished I could have a school life like that!

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.040
See you at school!

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:48.260
Who's she?

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.980
N-No idea.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.640
Hey, Maeda-kun.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:57.500
How about taking a photo of me sometime?

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:01.620
It can be with Kano-chan. Okay?

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:02.840
S-Sure.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:03.930
It's a promise, then!

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.760
See you later!

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:07.930
Right, see you.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.860
Good morning, Misumi-san.

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:15.720
G-Good morning, Niimi-san.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:18.350
It's been a while. How are you doing?

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:19.280
I'm doing fine—

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:20.740
Found you!

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.220
Morning, Haruka!

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:24.690
I missed you! Long time no see.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:27.700
Good morning. How are you?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.540
<i>Niimi Haruka.</i>

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:32.710
<i>She has a bright personality and her grades are top-notch.</i>

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:35.440
<i>She's also the ace of the Tennis Club and popular among her classmates.</i>

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:40.600
<i>When we were kids, she and I often used to run around together in the park,</i>

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:43.720
<i>but before I knew it, she became a distant figure.</i>

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.220
How about taking a photo of me sometime?

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:50.960
<i>My encounter with the camera will change me.</i>

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:54.300
<i>Oh, who am I kidding?</i>

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.990
Niiyan, got a minute?

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:06.180
Yeah, come in.

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:08.180
D'ya have any pencil leads?

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:10.030
I ran out of them.

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:12.170
Help yourself. They're on the top of my desk.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:13.500
Okay, thanks.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:17.210
Huh, Niiyan, you're doing your homework <i>now ?</i>

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.380
Yeah.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:22.180
You should've at least tried to finish it all before the Lantern Festival.

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:24.080
I agree.

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.720
Huh? What's this?

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.640
Isn't this Paparin's camera?

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:29.320
What's it doing here?

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:31.720
It's <i>my camera now.</i>

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.900
What? No fair!

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:36.860
Why do you always get such expensive stuff?

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:38.240
It's a hand-me-down.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.860
Go complain to Dad, not me.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.180
You bet I will!

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:43.610
I'm definitely gonna make him
buy me some new clothes!

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.960
So, have you taken any photos yet?

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:49.740
Nope, none so far.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.720
What? How come?!

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.120
Dad gave you such a nice camera!

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.370
Isn't it not a waste?

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:56.870
That's one too many "not"s.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:58.670
Isn't it not a not a not a waste?

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:01.250
That's way too many "not"s.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.740
Hey, let's try taking some photos.

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.720
Come on, take some photos of me!

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.320
Of you?

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.980
I guess I can.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.440
Yay!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.160
Bunny peace!

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.960
Niiyan, hurry up!

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:26.560
It's a photo shoot, a photo shoot!

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:28.680
I'll be Pretty Rabbie!

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.660
<i>This was the last night of my summer break.</i>

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:34.370
<i>Like every year, this year's summer
was completely uneventful.</i>

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.400
<i>Well, my dad gave me something
even though it wasn't my birthday.</i>

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:40.860
<i>It was a digital single-lens reflex camera.</i>

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:45.550
<i>Kouga Academy.</i>

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:48.800
<i>A private high school you could find practically anywhere else.</i>

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.050
<i>If anything's special about our school,</i>

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:55.930
<i>it's the freedom students have and how
passionate they are in their club activities.</i>

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:04.520
P-Please excuse me!

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:09.780
If you see me around the school, feel free to say hi!

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:18.020
I don't know how she could've gotten the
wrong classroom on her first day at work!

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:21.660
All right, I'll be taking roll now.

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:22.850
Ichinose-kun.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:23.540
Here!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.680
Akashi-san.

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:25.590
Here!

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:26.780
Tani-kun.

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:27.680
Here.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:29.940
<i>So she was a trainee teacher?</i>

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:35.050
<i>It's been forty days since I was last at school.</i>

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:37.310
<i>Nothing about it has really changed.</i>

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:40.080
<i>Time passes just like it always has.</i>

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:42.690
<i>The same classrooms.</i>

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.190
<i>The same uniform.</i>

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.190
<i>The same campus.</i>

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:57.990
Wh-Whoa!

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:59.160
Sorry!

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:02.360
Geez, that's dangerous!

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:04.240
And against the school rules!

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:10.270
<i>If there was anything different...</i>

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:13.300
Wait!

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:16.800
My summer oranges...

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:21.600
<i>it's that I now saw everyone as potential photo subjects.</i>

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:41.700
Who's that?

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.170
A-A photo opportunity!

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:02.640
H-Hello.

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:04.890
Hello.

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:09.000
Um... my class is having P.E. here next period.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:11.460
Uh, how do I put this...

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:14.370
I was looking around for photo subjects.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:17.070
Photo subjects?

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.200
Yeah.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.600
And then I saw you dancing here.

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:22.490
Right.

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:26.830
What? You're Kano-chan's brother?!

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:29.880
And you're friends with Kanon?

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.080
Yes!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:32.900
Nice to meet you.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.990
I'm Sakura Mai from class 1-B.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:38.340
I'm Maeda Kazuya from class 2-B.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:42.850
I had no idea Kano-chan had an older brother.

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:48.100
I didn't know Kanon had a friend who does rhythmic gymnastics either.

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:55.280
Kano-chan and I are really good friends.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.880
Really?

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:02.870
The flowing river never stops,

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:05.620
and yet the water never stays the same.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:09.980
Foam floats upon the pools, scattering, re-forming,

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:12.130
never lingering long.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:22.050
<i>Compared to the me during summer break,
I felt like a different person.</i>

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.140
<i>One becomes much bolder with a camera.</i>

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:28.920
<i>It helps you escape from your monotonous everyday life.</i>

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:31.460
<i>That's the feeling I got.</i>

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:44.380
Hey, Darts'un!

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:47.270
Earth to Darts'un!

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:48.870
Can you hear me?

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.040
Oh, it's you, Nonoka.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.380
What do you mean, "Oh"?

00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:58.120
I called out Darts'un so many times.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.300
Did you now?

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:02.050
I'd appreciate it if you could stop calling me Darts'un, though.

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:05.180
Why? You're Darts'un, for darts!

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:06.860
You don't like the name?

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:09.180
How about Billy, for billiards?

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:12.610
Or it can be about how you gave up the electric guitar in three weeks—

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:15.190
Don't bring up past wounds.

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:19.950
You played darts the longest, so Darts'un suits you best.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:20.980
Right?

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:26.040
So what's that you're holding?

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.240
Some new hobby?

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:31.120
Oh, it's a hand-me-down from my dad.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.680
Ooh, how nice.

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:35.160
Have you taken lots of photos?

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.240
Sorta.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:40.260
You forgot to photograph something very important, though.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:41.620
Like what?

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:45.930
A certain healthy, fine, and beautiful girl who brims with youth and plays softball.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.540
Where?

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:50.820
No need to hold back, y'know.

00:11:50.820 --> 00:11:52.850
You can take as many photos as you want now!

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.360
Just say so if you want your photo taken.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:58.110
Please, take a photo of me!

00:11:58.720 --> 00:11:59.900
All right.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.110
Let's do this!

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.620
What was the silly face for?

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:13.180
It was on a whim! Just felt like it.

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:15.320
See you around, Darts'un!

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:16.860
Right, see you.

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.630
She felt like it, huh?

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:23.960
Nice approach!

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:39.180
You actually got a photo subject
to ask you to take a photo of her.

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:40.280
Impressive.

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:41.980
Your future is bright.

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:43.530
What do you mean?

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:45.820
Your camera, of course.

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:50.650
I apologize for this, but I've been
following your every movement today.

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.620
You were tailing me?

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.720
You didn't notice me at all, right?

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:57.640
Yeah, I didn't.

00:12:57.640 --> 00:13:02.280
You need to expand your horizons and keep an eye on your surroundings.

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:04.710
You're too focused on the subject in front of you.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.080
I'm Kudou Hiromichi of class 3-A.

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:12.310
I'm the president of the Photography Club.

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:14.980
Well? Won't you join the Photography Club?

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.730
You have great potential.

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:17.850
Huh?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.110
Look.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:24.110
The stagnancy of Kouga Academy.

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.110
Students working hard in club activities.

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:27.870
Students hurrying home.

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:31.590
We have here people living typical, everyday lives.

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:33.360
But just imagine...

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:37.750
how a sudden gust of wind might blow upwards!

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.380
Right.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:42.300
Oh, how sweet such a sight would be!

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:51.220
This is the Photography Club's clubroom.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:54.700
Curtains?

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:57.230
The room's split down the middle.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:00.110
Oh, no need to worry about that.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.980
Allow me to introduce my club members.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.360
Conserve Energy!

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:07.490
I'm Nakagawa Itta of class 2-A.

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:09.740
Leave all the low-angle shots to me!

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.010
Nice to meet you.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.290
H-Hello.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.030
His nickname's Low-Angle Nakagawa.

00:14:17.030 --> 00:14:17.720
Next is...

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:20.290
I'm Azuma Takashi, also of class 2-A.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:23.880
I'm good with high-angle shots.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.500
Nice to meet you.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.380
His nickname is Boob-Glimpse Azuma.

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:29.260
Hello.

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:32.160
Borderline eroticism is aesthetics.

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:34.620
Borderline eroticism is art!

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.270
Don't you agree?

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:39.000
Uh... I guess.

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:41.150
So where's Uchida?

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:43.260
I don't see her around.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:44.720
I'm here.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.740
Oh, there you are.

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:49.860
Let me introduce her.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:52.960
The lone female of our group, Stealth Uchida.

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:55.240
I'm Uchida Yuuko, class 1-C.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:57.440
Uh, hello.

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:59.920
I'm Maeda Kazuya of class 2-B.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:00.870
Nice to meet you.

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:04.260
Uchida's specialty is stealth photography.

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:05.840
Stealth photography?

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:11.090
It's about melting into the background and photographing an unsuspecting subject.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:13.850
Isn't that sneak photog—

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.360
It's <i>not</i> sneak photography!

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:18.880
We don't hide our cameras in suitcases or plastic bags!

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:22.940
Plus, we're only allowed to photograph people in public areas recognized by the school.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:27.670
We also have to obtain the subject's consent before releasing the photo.

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.560
I see.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.840
Well? Aren't they all brilliant?

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:36.120
You'll become one of us!

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:41.680
Aren't you childhood friends with the
celebrated heroine of the school, Niimi Haruka?

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:45.120
You're also on friendly terms with
Masaki Nonoka, the Softball Club ace,

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:48.660
and Sakura Mai of the Rhythmic Gymnastics Club.

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:51.380
Work for the sake of our club!

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:54.140
<i>Huh?</i> That's <i>why?!</i>

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:56.360
The Photography Club's fun!

00:15:56.360 --> 00:16:03.020
Now then, shall we work together to preserve the
youthfulness of our female students to our hearts' desire?

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.900
Tada!

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.720
Stop tempting him!

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.420
I'm Kurebayashi Katsumi of class 3-A.

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:15.660
I'm the president of the Photo Club.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.240
Kurebayashi.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:21.040
What's the meaning of barging into our clubroom without warning?

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.160
Only through the air!

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.420
Aerial trespass.

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:25.800
The Photo Club?

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:27.700
What's the Photo Club?

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:29.440
Is it different from the Photography Club?

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:30.860
Completely different!

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:33.680
Don't lump us together with this shady club!

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:37.580
So you were listening to us?

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:40.280
Do you even give a damn about what privacy means?

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:45.240
I talked with the Student Council President to create the
Photo Club because you didn't want me in the Photography Club.

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:46.620
The Student Council President?

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:47.560
That's right.

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:51.940
That's why all of the school's official photos are taken by the Photo Club.

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:54.320
That means the Photo Club is the official—

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.530
Photography doesn't care whether something's official or not!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.530
Conserve Energy!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.530
Every little bit counts

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.120
I don't care what Muroto or you girls say.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:02.160
The Photography Club is a properly and formally recognized club!

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:04.720
Indeed.

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:09.670
We don't have enough members, and Ruu is already in the Volleyball Club, so we aren't a proper club.

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:13.080
Onee-sama, I can quit the Volleyball Club anytime—

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:14.170
You mustn't!

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:17.860
Hey, Maeda-kun, why don't you join our club?

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:21.560
No Entry!!

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.940
We'll be one step closer to
becoming a proper club if you do!

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:24.740
Think of how the Kikuma River changes its appearance with the four seasons!

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:28.400
Don't you want to capture such beautiful scenery with us?!

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:31.400
Beautiful scenery? Don't make me laugh.

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:35.280
There is nothing more beautiful than borderline eroticism!

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:39.740
Everyone in our club is a girl!
You'll have a wonderful time with us!

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.150
Don't be seduced!

00:17:41.150 --> 00:17:43.740
Go where the wind blows, where your heart goes!

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:45.000
Together with us,

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.500
we shall pursue true beauty!

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:57.550
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:01.090
<i>Am I really gonna take photos like these?</i>

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:03.720
<i>Wait, is it even okay to be doing that?</i>

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:08.510
Onee-sama, we should give up!

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:16.460
What's wrong with being with me and that weirdo Sanehara?

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:18.340
Boys shouldn't be in the Photo Club.

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:22.010
Gender is irrelevant to one's love of photography!

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.290
I'm not happy about this!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:31.620
An artist must always reveal what's inside himself!

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:33.920
You must struggle against your common sense!

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.170
Maeda, accept your fate!

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:40.180
Well then, which club will you join?!

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:43.560
<i>I don't want to take dodgy photos.</i>

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.680
<i>But what should I do?</i>

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:47.660
<i>Which club should I join to end this standoff?</i>

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:50.440
Now, which will it be?!

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:58.280
The Photography Club... I guess?

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:01.240
Yay!

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:04.080
There we go!

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:06.300
You're very welcome, our new Hero!

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:09.080
Uh, well, I still haven't really...

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.660
You're a beginner with the camera, right?

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:14.980
We'll teach you everything you'll need to know.

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:17.600
We're kind to our friends.

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:20.590
You have the same scent as I do.

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:25.710
Man, he was lured by Kudou's temptations.

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:27.600
Stop making me sound like the bad guy!

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.340
I'll see you around, Maeda-kun.

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:33.800
We may be in different clubs, but
our love of photography is the same.

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:36.110
Feel free to come and say hi anytime.

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:38.360
Thank you, I will.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:39.830
We're going, Ruu.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:40.900
Okay!

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:51.380
<i>Looks like I joined a pretty wacky club.</i>

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.580
<i>Will I really be okay?</i>

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:14.400
You were...

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:15.930
What is it?

00:20:15.930 --> 00:20:18.020
Weren't you on the roof earlier,
taking pictures of the sky?

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:19.160
Well, yes.

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:20.530
I'm in the Photo Club.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.700
The Photo Club?

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:24.870
You must be Sanehara, then.

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:27.120
How do you know my name?

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:30.560
Well, uh... It's a long story.

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:33.370
Can I go now?

00:20:34.110 --> 00:20:35.190
Sure.

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:44.880
Huh?

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:46.300
Someone's still here.

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:48.410
<i>It's Misumi-san.</i>

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:51.380
<i>Isn't that Niimi-san's desk?</i>

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:55.420
<i>What's she doing?</i>

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:58.820
<i>She's crying?!</i>

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:20.050
Can you keep it a secret?

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:24.830
Keep it a secret.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:29.260
Wh-What?

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:34.830
The fact that I was sitting at Niimi-san's desk and crying.

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:38.650
Don't tell anybody, especially her.

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:41.220
Sure, but why?

00:21:55.360 --> 00:21:58.120
Will you keep it a secret if I tell you the reason?

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:05.800
Yeah.

00:23:40.580 --> 00:23:42.230
Welcome!

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:44.310
Welcome to the Photography Club.

00:23:44.310 --> 00:23:46.020
Photos must be borderline erotic.

00:23:46.020 --> 00:23:47.860
Beauty must be borderline erotic.

00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:49.440
Art must be borderline erotic.

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:52.620
Everything must be borderline erotic.

00:23:52.620 --> 00:23:56.320
Even if the ruthless light shines down and masks the viewfinder,

00:23:56.320 --> 00:23:58.160
the time of liberation will come!

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:00.160
Find! Aim! And capture!

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:04.000
Pursue every billowing fold of the skirt hem!

00:24:06.230 --> 00:24:08.780
Pervy photos aren't allowed, got it?
